WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.288 --> 00:00:19.709
upon a time, there lived a boy named Hong Gildong.

2
00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:25.631
He was the son of Lord Hong, a rich and powerful official.

3
00:00:27.131 --> 00:00:31.978
One day while Gildong was reading, he heard servants whispering about him.

4
00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:35.860
"Why does that boy bother reading so much?"

5
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:37.401
one servant said.

6
00:00:37.421 --> 00:00:39.522
"His father is a noble.

7
00:00:40.002 --> 00:00:41.403
But his late mother was a servant.

8
00:00:42.284 --> 00:00:43.365
That makes him lowborn."

9
00:00:47.407 --> 00:00:49.108
"Yes," another said.

10
00:00:49.128 --> 00:00:52.790
"He can never become a high official like his father.

11
00:00:53.611 --> 00:00:55.332
The law of the land prevents it."

12
00:00:57.684 --> 00:01:01.546
"He's even stronger than a grown man," the first servant said.

13
00:01:01.566 --> 00:01:05.168
"But he can't become a military leader either."

14
00:01:07.089 --> 00:01:08.469
Gildong had heard enough.

15
00:01:09.530 --> 00:01:12.551
He jumped to his feet and lifted a heavy chest.

16
00:01:16.013 --> 00:01:19.895
Bam! It made a loud sound as he slammed it down.

17
00:01:20.495 --> 00:01:22.116
The servants rushed away.

18
00:01:25.528 --> 00:01:28.449
"That will stop them from talking about me like that," he thought.

19
00:01:31.511 --> 00:01:34.612
Later Gildong spotted his father outside.

20
00:01:39.494 --> 00:01:43.596
As Gildong approached, Lord Hong thought of a dream he once had.

21
00:01:47.457 --> 00:01:51.179
Lord Hong stood by a river in a beautiful, misty valley.

22
00:01:52.419 --> 00:01:54.040
It was the land of the gods.

23
00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:59.131
Suddenly the calm river started to churn.

24
00:02:00.752 --> 00:02:02.653
The entire valley rumbled.

25
00:02:03.654 --> 00:02:08.298
A splendid blue dragon rose from the water and flew toward him.

26
00:02:13.261 --> 00:02:16.264
Though the dream was old, it was still vivid.

27
00:02:16.284 --> 00:02:21.748
"Father—I mean, Your Lordship," Gildong said.

28
00:02:23.128 --> 00:02:25.890
Gildong's voice shook Lord Hong out of the dream.

29
00:02:28.391 --> 00:02:29.632
Lord Hong frowned.

30
00:02:29.652 --> 00:02:32.373
"You know you must not call me Father.

31
00:02:33.614 --> 00:02:34.294
What do you want?"

32
00:02:34.314 --> 00:02:38.236
"Do you have any new books for me to read?"

33
00:02:38.576 --> 00:02:39.537
Gildong asked.

34
00:02:41.298 --> 00:02:42.498
Lord Hong sighed.

35
00:02:42.518 --> 00:02:48.962
"Gildong was born after my dream of a splendid dragon," he thought.

36
00:02:48.982 --> 00:02:52.944
"It was a sign that he is a gifted child.

37
00:02:54.092 --> 00:02:55.953
But nothing can change his low birth.

38
00:02:57.715 --> 00:03:00.516
Though I love him, I cannot show too much kindness."

39
00:03:02.238 --> 00:03:03.458
"What do you need books for?"

40
00:03:03.879 --> 00:03:04.999
Lord Hong snapped.

41
00:03:05.019 --> 00:03:07.561
"You don't need to learn."

42
00:03:09.142 --> 00:03:10.283
He stormed off.

43
00:03:13.605 --> 00:03:16.207
Gildong looked down, holding back tears.

44
00:03:19.609 --> 00:03:26.297
When he looked up, he saw his older half brother, Inhyun, laughing.

45
00:03:26.317 --> 00:03:28.219
Inhyun pretended to be Lord Hong.

46
00:03:28.239 --> 00:03:31.280
"What do you need books for?

47
00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:32.441
You don't need to learn."

48
00:03:33.982 --> 00:03:35.223
Gildong scowled.

49
00:03:35.243 --> 00:03:38.004
"You shouldn't mock His Lordship like that!

50
00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.205
Maybe you need to learn."

51
00:03:43.247 --> 00:03:44.668
"You can't talk to me like that!

52
00:03:48.230 --> 00:03:50.091
I'm noble and you're lowborn!"

53
00:03:50.451 --> 00:03:51.392
Inhyun shouted.

54
00:03:53.940 --> 00:03:57.363
He pushed Gildong hard, but Gildong didn't move.

55
00:04:03.028 --> 00:04:03.969
picked up a stick.

56
00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:08.153
"You want to learn?

57
00:04:08.533 --> 00:04:11.056
I'll teach you a lesson, servant boy."
